# EAS Build uploads a tarball of the whole monorepo (this file's directory).
# None of the AI-agent skill/doc directories are needed to build the app, and
# .claude/skills/* are symlinks into .agents/skills/* which EAS's Windows
# shallow-clone step can't recreate without elevated permissions (EPERM) —
# excluding them entirely avoids that failure and shrinks the upload.
#
# Patterns are anchored to the repo root (leading /) — apps/admin/assets
# holds the actual app icons and must NOT be excluded.
/.agents
/.claude
/agent
/assets
/scratch
